4. Source code
--------------

For the GPL-licensed components (lyrebird, and various Debian packages):

  * Lyrebird: the upstream repository above, at the tag matching the version recorded in the
    image labels (the Tor Project's package version, e.g. 0.9.0+tpo-1, corresponds to upstream
    tag lyrebird-0.9.0).
  * Packages from the Tor Project's apt repository: source packages are available from the same
    repository (add a deb-src line for deb.torproject.org to your apt sources and run
    "apt-get source <package>").
  * Debian packages: apt-get source <package>, or https://sources.debian.org/.
  * This repository holds the Dockerfile and scripts used to assemble the images.


